00:11:54,546 --> 00:11:56,844
Sihitaji kijiko.

241
00:11:56,867 --> 00:11:59,758
Je, unahitaji straw?

242
00:11:59,782 --> 00:12:03,248
Ni chai, kwa hiyo sihitaji straw.

243
00:12:03,271 --> 00:12:05,238
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

244
00:12:05,261 --> 00:12:07,878
Je, utatumia mfuko?

245
00:12:07,901 --> 00:12:10,399
Mfuko ni wa kulipia?

246
00:12:10,423 --> 00:12:13,956
Ndiyo, mfuko mmoja ni shilingi tatu.

247
00:12:13,979 --> 00:12:17,226
Basi, nipatie mfuko mmoja.

248
00:12:17,249 --> 00:12:20,537
Sawa, shilingi tatu zitaongezwa.

249
00:12:20,561 --> 00:12:22,794
Jumla ni pesa ngapi?

250
00:12:22,817 --> 00:12:26,417
Jumla ni shilingi mia nane hamsini.

251
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,812
Nitakulipa kwa pesa taslimu.

252
00:12:28,835 --> 00:12:30,872
Nitakupa elfu moja.

253
00:12:30,896 --> 00:12:33,429
Nimepokea elfu moja.

254
00:12:33,452 --> 00:12:36,585
Hii ni pesa zako zilizobaki, shilingi mia moja hamsini.

255
00:12:36,608 --> 00:12:38,855
Naweza kupata risiti?

256
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:42,516
Ndiyo, hii ni risiti yako.

257
00:12:42,539 --> 00:12:45,230
Chakula chako kimepashwa moto?

258
00:12:45,254 --> 00:12:48,021
Ndiyo, kimepashwa moto.

259
00:12:48,044 --> 00:12:50,924
Ni moto sana, hivi karibu.

260
00:12:50,948 --> 00:12:52,403
Asante sana.

261
00:12:52,426 --> 00:12:55,559
Nimeiweka kwenye mfuko wa kubeba.

262
00:12:55,582 --> 00:12:58,820
Asante kwa kunisaidia kwa uangalifu.

263
00:12:58,844 --> 00:13:01,936
Karibu tena.

264
00:13:01,959 --> 00:13:03,459
Sehemu ya 6: Mazungumzo ya Kupiga Picha

265
00:13:03,459 --> 00:13:05,345
Samahani.

266
00:13:05,368 --> 00:13:07,501
Samahani kidogo?

267
00:13:07,524 --> 00:13:10,592
Ndiyo, naomba?

268
00:13:10,615 --> 00:13:13,509
Unaweza kunipigia picha?

269
00:13:13,533 --> 00:13:15,266
Sawa, hakuna shida.

270
00:13:15,289 --> 00:13:17,959
Tupige picha.

271
00:13:17,982 --> 00:13:20,783
Tafadhali tumia simu hii.

272
00:13:20,807 --> 00:13:22,645
Sawa, nimeelewa.

273
00:13:22,668 --> 00:13:25,202
Je, upige picha kwa upande wa ulalo?

274
00:13:25,225 --> 00:13:28,004
Tafadhali pigia picha kwa upande wa wima.

275
00:13:28,027 --> 00:13:31,102
Nitaiweka nyuma kasri.

276
00:13:31,125 --> 00:13:32,335
Ndio.

277
00:13:32,358 --> 00:13:35,792
Tafadhali weka kasri ili ionekane vizuri.

278
00:13:35,816 --> 00:13:38,073
Uko tayari?

279
00:13:38,096 --> 00:13:40,096
Tutaanza sasa.

280
00:13:40,119 --> 00:13:42,086
Ndio, tafadhali.

281
00:13:42,109 --> 00:13:46,482
Sawa, chizi! Kasha.

282
00:13:46,505 --> 00:13:49,505
Naweza kupiga picha nyingine?

283
00:13:49,528 --> 00:13:51,366
Sawa, hakuna shida.

284
00:13:51,389 --> 00:13:54,081
Je, unataka kubadilisha pozi?

285
00:13:54,104 --> 00:13:55,504
Ndio.

286
00:13:55,527 --> 00:13:58,494
Tafadhali pigia picha hapa ukicheka.

287
00:13:58,517 --> 00:14:01,198
Haya, twende sasa.

288
00:14:01,221 --> 00:14:05,289
3, 2, 1.

289
00:14:05,312 --> 00:14:07,112
Asante sana.

290
00:14:07,135 --> 00:14:09,902
Niruhusu nikaguse.

291
00:14:09,925 --> 00:14:11,596
Tafadhali.

292
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:13,869
Imepigwa picha vizuri sana.

293
00:14:13,892 --> 00:14:15,692
Kweli ndivyo.

294
00:14:15,715 --> 00:14:18,182
Umepiga picha vizuri kabisa.

295
00:14:18,205 --> 00:14:20,459
Sawa, nzuri.

296
00:14:20,482 --> 00:14:22,015
Umetoka kwa utalii?

297
00:14:22,038 --> 00:14:25,440
Ndiyo, nimetoka Marekani.

298
00:14:25,463 --> 00:14:27,097
Nimeelewa.

299
00:14:27,121 --> 00:14:29,954
Unafurahia Japani?

300
00:14:29,977 --> 00:14:33,177
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana.

301
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:35,400
Hiyo ni nzuri kusikia.

302
00:14:35,423 --> 00:14:39,423
Samahani, kuna choo karibu hapa?

303
00:14:39,446 --> 00:14:41,179
Choo, ndiyo.

304
00:14:41,202 --> 00:14:44,499
Kipo nyuma ya mti mkubwa ule.

305
00:14:44,522 --> 00:14:47,322
Je, ni jengo lenye paa la nyekundu?

306
00:14:47,345 --> 00:14:51,122
Hapana, ni jengo lenye paa la buluu.

307
00:14:51,146 --> 00:14:53,154
Paa la buluu, nimeelewa.

308
00:14:53,178 --> 00:14:54,911
Asante, nimekuelewa.

309
00:14:54,934 --> 00:14:58,334
Kuna choo cha matumizi mengi pia.

310
00:14:58,357 --> 00:14:59,890
Umenisaidia sana.

311
00:14:59,913 --> 00:15:02,786
Loker za malipo ziko wapi?

312
00:15:02,810 --> 00:15:06,496
Loker za malipo ziko kwenye ingilio la kituo cha treni.

313
00:15:06,519 --> 00:15:09,495
Inachukua muda gani kwa miguu?

314
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:12,138
Inachukua dakika tano hivi.

315
00:15:12,162 --> 00:15:13,930
Ni karibu sana.

316
00:15:13,954 --> 00:15:15,820
Sawa, nzuri.

317
00:15:15,843 --> 00:15:18,877
Hii leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri, sivyo?

318
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:22,545
Ndiyo, ni siku nzuri kwa matembezi.

319
00:15:22,568 --> 00:15:26,181
Chukua picha nzuri nyingi.

320
00:15:26,204 --> 00:15:28,171
Asante, nitakufanya hivyo.

321
00:15:28,194 --> 00:15:31,240
Furahia siku yako.

322
00:15:31,264 --> 00:15:34,430
Wewe pia, furahia siku yako.

323
00:15:34,453 --> 00:15:35,953
Sehemu ya 7: Mwongozo wa Njia na Uthibitishaji wa Muda / Mwongozo wa Njia na Uthibitishaji wa Muda

324
00:15:35,953 --> 00:15:38,887
Asante kwa kupanda gari letu.

325
00:15:38,910 --> 00:15:41,843
Unaenda wapi?

326
00:15:41,866 --> 00:15:44,902
Tafadhali nipatie Tokyo Tower.

327
00:15:44,926 --> 00:15:47,292
Tokyo Tower, ndiyo.

328
00:15:47,315 --> 00:15:49,253
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

329
00:15:49,277 --> 00:15:52,648
Inachukua muda gani?

330
00:15:52,672 --> 00:15:56,159
Kama hakuna msongamano, inachukua dakika ishirini hivi.

331
00:15:56,182 --> 00:15:59,195
Sasa kuna msongamano barabarani?

332
00:15:59,219 --> 00:16:03,252
Kuna kazi kidogo ya ujenzi, kwa hivyo kuna msongamano.

333
00:16:03,275 --> 00:16:06,642
Je, inachukua dakika thelathini hivi?

334
00:16:06,665 --> 00:16:08,603
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

335
00:16:08,626 --> 00:16:11,593
Tafadhali fikiria dakika thelathini hivi.

336
00:16:11,616 --> 00:16:13,549
Sawa, nimeelewa.

337
00:16:13,572 --> 00:16:16,908
Siko na haraka, ni sawa.

338
00:16:16,932 --> 00:16:19,747
Je, mizigo yako itakua kwenye matundu ya gari?

339
00:16:19,771 --> 00:16:21,104
Ndio.

340
00:16:21,127 --> 00:16:24,405
Tafadhali weka sanduku moja la safari.

341
00:16:24,429 --> 00:16:26,919
Nitakulipia.

342
00:16:26,942 --> 00:16:29,775
Ni nzito, tafadhali jihadhari.

343
00:16:29,798 --> 00:16:31,365
Asante sana.

344
00:16:31,388 --> 00:16:33,721
Tunatoka sasa.

345
00:16:33,744 --> 00:16:36,544
Tafadhali funga mkanda wa kiti chako.

346
00:16:36,567 --> 00:16:38,044
Ndio.

347
00:16:38,067 --> 00:16:39,701
Tumefunga.

348
00:16:39,723 --> 00:16:43,193
Tutatumia barabara ya haraka?

349
00:16:43,217 --> 00:16:45,854
Kama tutatumia barabara ya haraka, itakuwa haraka zaidi?

350
00:16:45,877 --> 00:16:47,311
Ndio.

351
00:16:47,333 --> 00:16:50,421
Itakuwa haraka kwa dakika kumi hivi.

352
00:16:50,445 --> 00:16:53,978
Basi, tafadhali tumia barabara ya haraka.

353
00:16:54,001 --> 00:16:56,239
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

354
00:16:56,262 --> 00:16:59,338
Gharama ya barabara ya haraka itakuwa ya ziada.

355
00:16:59,361 --> 00:17:01,161
Nimeelewa.

356
00:17:01,184 --> 00:17:03,436
Hakuna tatizo.

357
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:06,426
Je, halijoto ya kiyoyozi inafaa?

358
00:17:06,449 --> 00:17:10,183
Ninahisi kidogo baridi, tafadhali punguza.

359
00:17:10,207 --> 00:17:12,307
Nitapunguza kidogo.

360
00:17:12,330 --> 00:17:14,797
Hivi vipo sawa?

361
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:16,986
Inafaa vizuri.

362
00:17:17,009 --> 00:17:18,609
Asante sana.

363
00:17:18,632 --> 00:17:22,199
Tutatumia njia yenye mandhari nzuri.

364
00:17:22,222 --> 00:17:26,589
Waa, naona daraja kubwa!

365
00:17:26,612 --> 00:17:29,745
Hiyo ni Rainbow Bridge.

366
00:17:29,768 --> 00:17:32,101
Ni nzuri sana!

367
00:17:32,124 --> 00:17:35,017
Naweza kupiga picha?

368
00:17:35,041 --> 00:17:36,508
Ndiyo.

369
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:39,064
Tafadhali piga nyingi.

370
00:17:39,087 --> 00:17:41,567
Tutafika hivi karibuni?

371
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:43,044
Ndio.

372
00:17:43,068 --> 00:17:45,966
Hiyo mbele ni Tokyo Tower.

373
00:17:45,989 --> 00:17:49,007
Tafadhali nisimamishe mbele ya lango hilo.

374
00:17:49,031 --> 00:17:51,198
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

375
00:17:51,221 --> 00:17:54,088
Nitakusimamisha mahali salama.

376
00:17:54,111 --> 00:17:56,364
Gharama ni kiasi gani?

377
00:17:56,387 --> 00:17:59,797
Jumla ni shilingi elfu tatu na mia mbili.

378
00:17:59,821 --> 00:18:03,623
Naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya usafiri?

379
00:18:03,646 --> 00:18:04,887
Ndio.

380
00:18:04,911 --> 00:18:06,799
Ndiyo, unaweza.

381
00:18:06,822 --> 00:18:09,555
Fanya malipo kwa kupiga kadi.

382
00:18:09,578 --> 00:18:11,812
Malipo yamekamilika.

383
00:18:11,836 --> 00:18:14,711
Angalia usisahau chochote.

384
00:18:14,734 --> 00:18:17,067
Asante sana.

385
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:18,590
Sehemu ya 8: Jinsi ya Kupokea Maagizo / Kupokea Maagizo ya Wateja

386
00:18:18,590 --> 00:18:20,629
Karibu sana.

387
00:18:20,652 --> 00:18:24,263
Tutapokea maagizo yako.

388
00:18:24,287 --> 00:18:25,932
Hujambo.

389
00:18:25,956 --> 00:18:28,772
Naweza kuangalia menyu?

390
00:18:28,796 --> 00:18:31,436
Haya, tafadhali.

391
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:34,533
Utakula hapa ndani?

392
00:18:34,556 --> 00:18:37,523
Nitachukua nje, tafadhali.

393
00:18:37,546 --> 00:18:40,154
Kutwaa nje, sawa.

394
00:18:40,177 --> 00:18:42,577
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

395
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:45,134
Je, mna kafe latte?

396
00:18:45,157 --> 00:18:48,731
Ndiyo, tuna ya moto na baridi.

397
00:18:48,754 --> 00:18:51,754
Nitakupokea kafe latte baridi moja.

398
00:18:51,777 --> 00:18:55,144
Ukubwa gani ungependa?

399
00:18:55,167 --> 00:18:58,014
Kuna ukubwa gani?

400
00:18:58,037 --> 00:19:02,015
Tuna short, regular, na large.

401
00:19:02,038 --> 00:19:04,732
Nitakupokea ukubwa wa regular.

402
00:19:04,756 --> 00:19:07,889
Je, sukari au maziwa ungependa?

403
00:19:07,912 --> 00:19:10,845
Usiniweke sukari.

404
00:19:10,868 --> 00:19:14,035
Je, ungependa kubadilisha kiwango cha barafu?

405
00:19:14,058 --> 00:19:17,025
Naweza kupunguza barafu kidogo?

406
00:19:17,048 --> 00:19:20,917
Ndiyo, nitakupokea na barafu kidogo.

407
00:19:20,941 --> 00:19:24,399
Je, naweza kubadilisha maziwa na maziwa ya soya?

408
00:19:24,422 --> 00:19:29,488
Unaweza kubadilisha na soya latte kwa shilingi zaidi hamsini.

409
00:19:29,511 --> 00:19:32,445
Ndiyo basi, nipe ya soya.

410
00:19:32,468 --> 00:19:35,534
Je, unataka kuagiza kitu kingine?

411
00:19:35,557 --> 00:19:39,728
Ninataka kununua keki pia, zipo aina gani?

412
00:19:39,751 --> 00:19:43,551
Tunapendekeza cheesecake na matcha tart.

413
00:19:43,574 --> 00:19:46,352
Nitachukua matcha tart moja.

414
00:19:46,375 --> 00:19:48,509
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

415
00:19:48,532 --> 00:19:51,898
Tutaiweka katika boksi ya kubeba.

416
00:19:51,921 --> 00:19:54,155
Naomba begi pia.

417
00:19:54,178 --> 00:19:57,072
Tutakupatia begi la karatasi.

418
00:19:57,095 --> 00:19:58,629
Asante sana.

419
00:19:58,652 --> 00:20:01,685
Je, utangoja ndani ya duka?

420
00:20:01,708 --> 00:20:04,541
Ndiyo, nitangoja hapa.

421
00:20:04,564 --> 00:20:07,433
Malipo yatafanywa mapema.

422
00:20:07,456 --> 00:20:09,623
Jumla ni pesa ngapi?

423
00:20:09,646 --> 00:20:13,879
Kwa kinywaji na keki ni shilingi mia nane themanini.

424
00:20:13,902 --> 00:20:16,269
Naweza kulipa kwa PayPay?

425
00:20:16,292 --> 00:20:19,766
Ndiyo, tafadhali onyesha barcode yako.

426
00:20:19,789 --> 00:20:22,356
Sawa, tumesoma.

427
00:20:22,379 --> 00:20:24,946
Asante sana.

428
00:20:24,969 --> 00:20:27,935
Hii ni risiti yako na nambari ya kuwaita.

429
00:20:27,958 --> 00:20:30,440
Je, nitaitwa kwa nambari?

430
00:20:30,464 --> 00:20:35,162
Ndiyo, utakapokuwa tayari tutakuita nambari tano.

431
00:20:35,186 --> 00:20:37,002
Sawa, nimeelewa.

432
00:20:37,025 --> 00:20:39,058
Nitaketi nikingoja.

433
00:20:39,081 --> 00:20:42,148
Bidhaa zako zimekwisha tayari.

434
00:20:42,171 --> 00:20:44,704
Mteja wa nambari tano.

435
00:20:44,727 --> 00:20:47,361
Ndiyo, mimi ndiye.

436
00:20:47,384 --> 00:20:49,384
Asante sana.

437
00:20:49,408 --> 00:20:50,908
Sehemu ya 9: Mazungumzo ya Kuomba Msaada / Kuomba Msaada kwa Kijapani

438
00:20:50,908 --> 00:20:52,686
Samahani.

439
00:20:52,709 --> 00:20:54,709
Tafadhali nisaidie.

440
00:20:54,732 --> 00:20:57,099
Umefanya nini?

441
00:20:57,122 --> 00:20:59,155
Unaendelea vizuri?

442
00:20:59,178 --> 00:21:02,545
Nimepoteza pochi yangu.

443
00:21:02,568 --> 00:21:05,401
Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

444
00:21:05,424 --> 00:21:07,824
Tulia kidogo.

445
00:21:07,847 --> 00:21:10,980
Sijui nilipoipoteza.

446
00:21:11,003 --> 00:21:14,487
Ulipoiona mara ya mwisho lini?

447
00:21:14,511 --> 00:21:18,349
Nilikua katika kafe saa moja iliyopita hivi.

448
00:21:18,372 --> 00:21:21,444
Je, unakumbuka ni kafe gani?

449
00:21:21,468 --> 00:21:25,001
Ni duka dogo jekundu karibu na kituo cha treni.

450
00:21:25,024 --> 00:21:27,630
Je, ni Starbucks?

451
00:21:27,654 --> 00:21:33,054
Hapana, sijui jina, ila ilikuwa duka dogo.

452
00:21:33,077 --> 00:21:36,910
Tafadhali niambie pochi yako ilikuwa rangi gani na umbo gani.

453
00:21:36,933 --> 00:21:40,667
Ni pochi ya ngozi nyeusi ya kufunguka mara mbili.

454
00:21:40,690 --> 00:21:43,723
Kulikuwa na nini ndani yake?

455
00:21:43,746 --> 00:21:47,588
Kulikuwa na pesa taslimu na kadi ya mkopo.

456
00:21:47,611 --> 00:21:50,648
Je, pasipoti yako pia ilikuwepo?

457
00:21:50,672 --> 00:21:54,238
Hapana, pasipoti yangu iko hotelini.

458
00:21:54,261 --> 00:21:56,795
Hiyo ni nzuri.

459
00:21:56,818 --> 00:21:59,818
Naomba jina lako.

460
00:21:59,841 --> 00:22:02,107
John Smith.

461
00:22:02,130 --> 00:22:06,197
Una nambari ya simu ya mawasiliano?

462
00:22:06,220 --> 00:22:08,953
Je, nambari ya simu ya hoteli inatosha?

463
00:22:08,976 --> 00:22:10,510
Ndio.

464
00:22:10,533 --> 00:22:13,980
Ndiyo, andika jina la hoteli na nambari yake.

465
00:22:14,004 --> 00:22:16,137
Nimeandika hapa.

466
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:20,132
Nitakuandalia karatasi ya taarifa ya kitu kilichopotea.

467
00:22:20,155 --> 00:22:22,989
Ningependa kukomesha kadi yangu ya mkopo.

468
00:22:23,011 --> 00:22:26,678
Inafaa upige simu kwa kampuni ya kadi mara moja.

469
00:22:26,701 --> 00:22:30,634
Unaweza kunisaidia kutafuta nambari ya simu?

470
00:22:30,657 --> 00:22:31,940
Ndio.

471
00:22:31,964 --> 00:22:34,930
Tutatafuta kwa kompyuta hii.

472
00:22:34,953 --> 00:22:37,368
Asante sana kwa ukaribu wako.

473
00:22:37,391 --> 00:22:41,688
Hii ndiyo nambari ya kampuni yako ya kadi.

474
00:22:41,712 --> 00:22:44,278
Nitapiga simu sasa hivi.

475
00:22:44,301 --> 00:22:47,136
Unaweza kutumia simu ya kituo cha polisi.

476
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,696
Asante sana.

477
00:22:48,719 --> 00:22:50,804
Umenisaidia sana.

478
00:22:50,828 --> 00:22:54,516
Ikiwa pochi yako itapatikana, tutakupigia simu hoteli.

479
00:22:54,540 --> 00:23:01,038
Natumai itapatikana... Nchini Japani, vitu vilivyopotea mara nyingi hurudishwa.

480
00:23:01,061 --> 00:23:03,728
Nimefarijika kusikia hayo.

481
00:23:03,751 --> 00:23:07,918
Unajua njia ya kwenda hoteli utakayolala leo?

482
00:23:07,941 --> 00:23:11,474
Kweli nimepotea njiani pia.

483
00:23:11,497 --> 00:23:16,530
Nitakuchapia ramani.

484
00:23:16,553 --> 00:23:18,593
Asante sana kwa wema wako.

485
00:23:18,617 --> 00:23:22,150
Endelea na tahadhari njiani kwenda hoteli.

486
00:23:22,173 --> 00:23:23,673
Sehemu ya 10: Huduma ya Kuondoka Hoteli / Utaratibu wa Kuondoka Hoteli

487
00:23:23,673 --> 00:23:26,155
Habari za asubuhi.

488
00:23:26,179 --> 00:23:28,114
Unaondoka hoteli?

489
00:23:28,137 --> 00:23:32,804
Ndiyo, naomba niondoke.

490
00:23:32,828 --> 00:23:36,228
Tutakupokea ufunguo wa chumba chako.

491
00:23:36,251 --> 00:23:40,691
Nambari ya chumba ni 305.

492
00:23:40,714 --> 00:23:42,354
Tafadhali.

493
00:23:42,377 --> 00:23:44,377
Asante sana.

494
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:48,434
Ulitumia vinywaji au chochote kwenye chumba?

495
00:23:48,457 --> 00:23:51,823
Nilitumia maji kutoka kwenye jokofu.

496
00:23:51,846 --> 00:23:55,455
Maji ni bei ya shilingi 200 kwa chupa.

497
00:23:55,478 --> 00:23:58,012
Nitakulipa kwa pesa taslimu.

498
00:23:58,035 --> 00:23:59,635
Tafadhali.

499
00:23:59,658 --> 00:24:03,141
Tutakupokea shilingi 200 kamili.

500
00:24:03,164 --> 00:24:05,731
Ulikaa vizuri hapa?

501
00:24:05,754 --> 00:24:08,887
Nilikaa vizuri sana.

502
00:24:08,910 --> 00:24:11,802
Tunafurahi kusikia hivyo.

503
00:24:11,825 --> 00:24:16,203
Chumba kilikuwa safi na kiamsha kinywa kilikuwa kitamu.

504
00:24:16,227 --> 00:24:17,829
Asante sana.

505
00:24:17,852 --> 00:24:20,985
Nitawafahamisha wale wanaopika.

506
00:24:21,008 --> 00:24:24,419
Utaratibu wa kuondoka umekamilika.

507
00:24:24,442 --> 00:24:29,309
Unaweza kukubali kuweka mizigo yangu mpaka jioni?

508
00:24:29,332 --> 00:24:33,026
Ndiyo, tutafurahi kuviweka.

509
00:24:33,049 --> 00:24:37,216
Nina masanduku mawili.

510
00:24:37,239 --> 00:24:40,474
Tutakuweka tiketi hii.

511
00:24:40,497 --> 00:24:42,330
Hii ni tiketi ya kubadilishia?

512
00:24:42,353 --> 00:24:43,925
Ndio.

513
00:24:43,949 --> 00:24:47,482
Usikate nambari hii.

514
00:24:47,505 --> 00:24:49,356
Sawa, nimeelewa.

515
00:24:49,380 --> 00:24:52,231
Ninaweza kuviweka mpaka saa ngapi?

516
00:24:52,254 --> 00:24:55,949
Tafadhali rudi kabla ya saa mbili usiku leo.

517
00:24:55,973 --> 00:25:00,906
Treni yangu ni saa moja, nitakuja saa kumi na mbili.

518
00:25:00,929 --> 00:25:03,015
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

519
00:25:03,039 --> 00:25:05,439
Tutakungoja.

520
00:25:05,462 --> 00:25:09,866
Kuna mgahawa mzuri wa soba karibu hapa?

521
00:25:09,889 --> 00:25:14,489
Kuna mgahawa maarufu wa soba nyuma ya hoteli.

522
00:25:14,512 --> 00:25:16,350
Ninaweza kwenda kwa miguu?

523
00:25:16,373 --> 00:25:17,973
Ndio.

524
00:25:17,996 --> 00:25:20,396
Ni dakika tatu kwa miguu.

525
00:25:20,419 --> 00:25:22,819
Nitakwenda huko.

526
00:25:22,842 --> 00:25:26,376
Je, naweza kukupa ramani ya kwenda huko?

527
00:25:26,399 --> 00:25:27,850
Tafadhali.

528
00:25:27,874 --> 00:25:31,649
Mahali hapa kwenye ramani palipo na alama nyekundu.

529
00:25:31,672 --> 00:25:33,872
Inaeleweka sana!

530
00:25:33,895 --> 00:25:35,495
Asante sana.

531
00:25:35,518 --> 00:25:39,285
Furahia siku yako leo pia.

532
00:25:39,308 --> 00:25:43,108
Wafanyakazi wote hapa walikuwa wazuri sana kweli.

533
00:25:43,131 --> 00:25:47,071
Ninashukuru kwa maneno yako, naona fahari kubwa.

534
00:25:47,094 --> 00:25:51,294
Nikija tena Japani, nitaketi hapa.

535
00:25:51,317 --> 00:25:54,131
Karibu tena wakati wowote.

536
00:25:54,155 --> 00:25:58,555
Basi, nitakuja baadaye kuchukua mizigo yangu.

537
00:25:58,578 --> 00:26:00,350
Safari njema!

538
00:26:00,373 --> 00:26:02,740
Tutakungoja.

539
00:26:02,763 --> 00:26:04,263
Sehemu ya 11: Jinsi ya Kununua Tiketi ya Shinkansen

540
00:26:04,263 --> 00:26:06,396
Karibu sana.

541
00:26:06,419 --> 00:26:10,266
Ninataka kununua tiketi ya Shinkansen.

542
00:26:10,290 --> 00:26:13,490
Unaenda wapi?

543
00:26:13,514 --> 00:26:16,606
Ninataka kwenda Kyoto.

544
00:26:16,630 --> 00:26:18,671
Kyoto, sawa.

545
00:26:18,694 --> 00:26:21,563
Unaondoka leo?

546
00:26:21,586 --> 00:26:25,519
Ndiyo, nataka kupanda treni ya mchana leo.

547
00:26:25,542 --> 00:26:27,776
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

548
00:26:27,799 --> 00:26:32,492
Unapendelea kiti huru au kiti maalum?

549
00:26:32,515 --> 00:26:35,292
Nitapendelea kiti maalum, tafadhali.

550
00:26:35,316 --> 00:26:38,882
Unafikiria saa ngapi itakuwa nzuri?

551
00:26:38,905 --> 00:26:42,905
Kuna treni inayoondoka saa sita mchana?

552
00:26:42,928 --> 00:26:47,339
Kuna treni ya 'Hikari' inayoondoka saa sita na dakika tano.

553
00:26:47,363 --> 00:26:49,429
Nitachukua hiyo.

554
00:26:49,452 --> 00:26:52,819
Una nafasi unayopendelea?

555
00:26:52,842 --> 00:26:56,709
Kuna nafasi ambayo inaweza kuona Mlima Fuji?

556
00:26:56,732 --> 00:26:58,215
Ndio.

557
00:26:58,239 --> 00:27:01,681
Kiti E kiko upande wa Mlima Fuji.

558
00:27:01,705 --> 00:27:05,387
Nitapendelea kiti upande wa Mlima Fuji.

559
00:27:05,410 --> 00:27:07,468
Sawa, nimeelewa.

560
00:27:07,492 --> 00:27:10,825
Nitakupatia kiti E karibu na dirisha.

561
00:27:10,848 --> 00:27:12,615
Asante sana.

562
00:27:12,638 --> 00:27:16,933
Mtu mzima mmoja tu, sawa?

563
00:27:16,956 --> 00:27:19,756
Ndiyo, mmoja tu.

564
00:27:19,779 --> 00:27:21,422
Unataka tiketi ya kwenda tu?

565
00:27:21,446 --> 00:27:23,179
Au ya kwenda na kurudi?

566
00:27:23,202 --> 00:27:26,085
Nitapendelea tiketi ya kwenda tu.

567
00:27:26,109 --> 00:27:30,767
Bei ni shilingi kumi na tatu elfu, mia nane.

568
00:27:30,791 --> 00:27:33,726
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

569
00:27:33,749 --> 00:27:37,349
Tafadhali weka pesa hapa kwenye mashine.

570
00:27:37,372 --> 00:27:39,840
Nimeiweka.

571
00:27:39,864 --> 00:27:42,864
Tafadhali ingiza nambari yako ya siri.

572
00:27:42,887 --> 00:27:45,053
Nimeiingiza.

573
00:27:45,076 --> 00:27:46,732
Asante sana.

574
00:27:46,756 --> 00:27:49,156
Chukua tiketi yako.

575
00:27:49,179 --> 00:27:54,112
Kuna duka au mauzo ndani ya treni?

576
00:27:54,135 --> 00:27:58,771
Ndiyo, kuna gari dogo linalouza chakula na vinywaji.

577
00:27:58,795 --> 00:28:01,528
Ninataka kununua chakula pia.

578
00:28:01,551 --> 00:28:05,518
Kuna duka la chakula kitamu kwenye jukwaa pia.

579
00:28:05,541 --> 00:28:07,474
Nimeelewa.

580
00:28:07,497 --> 00:28:09,988
Nitatazama kabla ya kupanda.

581
00:28:10,011 --> 00:28:14,066
Shinkansen itaondoka kwenye jukwaa la nne.

582
00:28:14,090 --> 00:28:16,709
Jukwaa la nne, sawa.

583
00:28:16,733 --> 00:28:18,866
Sawa, nimeelewa.

584
00:28:18,889 --> 00:28:22,731
Tafadhali kaa tayari kwenye jukwaa dakika tano kabla ya kuondoka.

585
00:28:22,754 --> 00:28:26,788
Asante kwa msaada wako mzuri.

586
00:28:26,811 --> 00:28:29,777
Safari njema!

587
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:31,300
Sehemu ya 12: Utaratibu wa Kuingia Mtoni wa Moto

588
00:28:31,300 --> 00:28:33,189
Karibu sana.

589
00:28:33,212 --> 00:28:35,746
Unasema kuoga kwa siku moja?

590
00:28:35,769 --> 00:28:39,302
Ndiyo, nataka kuingia katika maji moto ya moto.

591
00:28:39,325 --> 00:28:41,258
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

592
00:28:41,281 --> 00:28:45,248
Mtu mzima mmoja, bei ni elfu moja ya shilingi.

593
00:28:45,271 --> 00:28:47,804
Nitakulipa ada ya kuoga.

594
00:28:47,827 --> 00:28:50,395
Ndiyo, elfu moja ya shilingi.

595
00:28:50,419 --> 00:28:52,264
Asante sana.

596
00:28:52,288 --> 00:28:56,025
Samahani, je, taulo zinazopatikana?

597
00:28:56,049 --> 00:28:59,917
Hapana, taulo zinahitaji malipo tofauti.

598
00:28:59,941 --> 00:29:02,974
Naweza kukodisha taulo?

599
00:29:02,997 --> 00:29:09,764
Ndiyo, taulo ya uso ni mia mbili, na taulo kubwa ni mia tatu.

600
00:29:09,787 --> 00:29:11,991
Nataka kununua zote mbili.

601
00:29:12,014 --> 00:29:14,347
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

602
00:29:14,370 --> 00:29:16,983
Pamoja zitakuwa mia tano.

603
00:29:17,007 --> 00:29:19,245
Haya, tafadhali.

604
00:29:19,268 --> 00:29:21,038
Asante sana.

605
00:29:21,061 --> 00:29:24,028
Nitakupa taulo.

606
00:29:24,051 --> 00:29:27,728
Je, kuna sheria za jinsi ya kuingia katika maji moto?

607
00:29:27,752 --> 00:29:31,011
Kuna adabu kadhaa muhimu.

608
00:29:31,034 --> 00:29:32,925
Tafadhali niambie.

609
00:29:32,949 --> 00:29:38,015
Kwanza, safisha mwili wako kabla ya kuingia kwenye beseni la maji.

610
00:29:38,038 --> 00:29:41,306
Nitaosha mwili kwanza kabla ya kuingia.

611
00:29:41,330 --> 00:29:42,944
Ndio.

612
00:29:42,968 --> 00:29:47,101
Safisha mwili wako vizuri kwenye eneo la kuosha.

613
00:29:47,124 --> 00:29:48,491
Sawa, nimeelewa.

614
00:29:48,514 --> 00:29:52,047
Je, naweza kuweka taulo ndani ya beseni la maji?

615
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:56,157
Hapana, usiweke taulo ndani ya beseni la maji.

616
00:29:56,181 --> 00:29:58,981
Nitafanya nini na taulo?

617
00:29:59,004 --> 00:30:03,804
Weka juu ya kichwa chako au kando ya bafu.

618
00:30:03,827 --> 00:30:05,502
Sawa, nimeelewa.

619
00:30:05,525 --> 00:30:08,558
Watu wenye nywele ndefu wanafanya nini?

620
00:30:08,581 --> 00:30:13,115
Funga nywele zako ili zisisogee ndani ya maji.

621
00:30:13,139 --> 00:30:14,939
Nimeelewa.

622
00:30:14,962 --> 00:30:18,695
Je, kuna lockers kwenye chumba cha kubadilisha nguo?

623
00:30:18,718 --> 00:30:19,966
Ndio.

624
00:30:19,989 --> 00:30:22,637
Ndiyo, kuna lockers zenye funguo.

625
00:30:22,661 --> 00:30:25,309
Ninaweza kuweka vitu vyangu muhimu ndani, basi.

626
00:30:25,333 --> 00:30:26,820
Ndio.

627
00:30:26,843 --> 00:30:30,443
Shika ufunguo mkononi wakati wa kuingia bafuni.

628
00:30:30,466 --> 00:30:34,033
Baada ya kuoga, naweza kununua kinywaji?

629
00:30:34,056 --> 00:30:39,189
Kuna mashine za kuuza maziwa na juisi kwenye eneo la kupumzika.

630
00:30:39,212 --> 00:30:41,179
Nitakifurahia sana.

631
00:30:41,201 --> 00:30:42,935
Nitakwenda sasa.

632
00:30:42,958 --> 00:30:45,891
Karibu ufurahie na upumzike.

633
00:30:45,914 --> 00:30:47,414
Sehemu ya 13: Mabadiliko ya Hifadhi ya Treni ya Shinkansen na Mahitaji ya Ukubwa wa Mzigo

634
00:30:47,414 --> 00:30:51,783
Mteja, naomba niambie ni jambo gani?

635
00:30:51,806 --> 00:30:55,940
Nataka kubadilisha hifadhi yangu ya treni ya kesho.

636
00:30:55,963 --> 00:30:57,736
Mabadiliko, basi.

637
00:30:57,759 --> 00:31:01,646
Tafadhali naomba nione tiketi yako.

638
00:31:01,670 --> 00:31:04,403
Hii ndiyo tiketi yangu.

639
00:31:04,426 --> 00:31:06,305
Asante sana.

640
00:31:06,329 --> 00:31:09,227
Unataka kubadilisha vipi?

641
00:31:09,250 --> 00:31:12,284
Nina mfuko mkubwa wa safari.

642
00:31:12,307 --> 00:31:14,840
Mzigo mkubwa sana.

643
00:31:14,863 --> 00:31:18,138
Mzigo wako ni wa ukubwa gani?

644
00:31:18,162 --> 00:31:23,979
Jumla ya urefu, upana na kimo ni sentimita 180.

645
00:31:24,002 --> 00:31:29,572
Kwa ukubwa huo, utahitaji kuhifadhi nafasi maalum kwa mizigo mikubwa.

646
00:31:29,596 --> 00:31:32,444
Siwezi kuweka kwenye kiti cha kawaida?

647
00:31:32,468 --> 00:31:33,923
Ndio.

648
00:31:33,946 --> 00:31:40,680
Mizigo yenye jumla ya pande tatu zaidi ya sentimita 160 inahitaji hifadhi.

649
00:31:40,703 --> 00:31:43,669
Kuna nafasi ya kuweka mzigo?

650
00:31:43,692 --> 00:31:48,695
Kuna nafasi nyuma ya kiti cha mwisho kwenye gari.

651
00:31:48,719 --> 00:31:53,486
Naweza kubadilisha nafasi hiyo pamoja na kiti changu?

652
00:31:53,509 --> 00:31:57,283
Tafadhali tujulishe saa unayotaka kesho.

653
00:31:57,306 --> 00:32:01,284
Ningependa treni ya saa nne asubuhi hivi.

654
00:32:01,307 --> 00:32:03,953
Nitatafuta na kukujulisha kama kuna viti vilivyowazi.

655
00:32:03,976 --> 00:32:06,010
Subiri kidogo, tafadhali.

656
00:32:06,033 --> 00:32:07,966
Asante sana.

657
00:32:07,989 --> 00:32:13,801
Kuna nafasi ya mizigo mikubwa kwenye treni inayoondoka saa nne na robo asubuhi.

658
00:32:13,824 --> 00:32:15,958
Sawa, nzuri.

659
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:18,314
Nitachukua kiti hicho.

660
00:32:18,337 --> 00:32:22,546
Kiti chako kitakuwa kwenye mstari wa mwisho, karibu na dirisha.

661
00:32:22,569 --> 00:32:27,003
Je, naweza kuweka mizigo yangu nyuma ya kiti changu?

662
00:32:27,026 --> 00:32:28,628
Ndio.

663
00:32:28,651 --> 00:32:32,269
Nafasi hiyo ni maalum kwa abiria walioagizwa.

664
00:32:32,292 --> 00:32:35,629
Je, kuna ada yoyote inayohitajika?

665
00:32:35,653 --> 00:32:40,460
Kama utahifadhi mapema, hakuna ada ya ziada.

666
00:32:40,483 --> 00:32:43,052
Hivyo ina maana naweza kubadilisha bila malipo, sawa?

667
00:32:43,076 --> 00:32:44,609
Ndio.

668
00:32:44,632 --> 00:32:47,799
Hii ndiyo tiketi yako mpya.

669
00:32:47,822 --> 00:32:49,658
Nitathibitisha.

670
00:32:49,681 --> 00:32:53,814
Inaandikwa kuwa kuna nafasi ya mizigo mikubwa.

671
00:32:53,837 --> 00:32:55,251
Ndio.

672
00:32:55,275 --> 00:32:57,242
Sawa kabisa.

673
00:32:57,265 --> 00:33:00,363
Asante kwa kunisaidia kwa upole.

674
00:33:00,386 --> 00:33:03,469
Safari njema, endelea na tahadhari.

675
00:33:03,493 --> 00:33:04,993
Sehemu ya 14: Jinsi ya Kujaza Mafuta ya Petroli / Jinsi ya Kujaza Mafuta ya Gari

676
00:33:04,993 --> 00:33:08,160
Karibu sana.

677
00:33:08,183 --> 00:33:11,249
Unataka kujaza mafuta ya petroli, ndiyo?

678
00:33:11,272 --> 00:33:13,713
Ndio, tafadhali.

679
00:33:13,737 --> 00:33:17,357
Ungependa aina gani?

680
00:33:17,380 --> 00:33:22,581
Nimepanga gari, ni aina gani ya mafuta ninaweka?

681
00:33:22,604 --> 00:33:29,537
Tafadhali angalia nyuma ya mlango wa mafuta au kwenye cheti cha gari.

682
00:33:29,560 --> 00:33:33,327
Kuna stika nyekundu.

683
00:33:33,350 --> 00:33:37,489
Stika nyekundu inamaanisha ni mafuta ya kawaida (regular).

684
00:33:37,512 --> 00:33:40,946
Nitapenda mafuta ya kawaida, na kujaza hadi juu.

685
00:33:40,969 --> 00:33:43,202
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

686
00:33:43,225 --> 00:33:47,992
Je, naweza kusafisha dirisha?

687
00:33:48,015 --> 00:33:50,499
Ndio, tafadhali.

688
00:33:50,522 --> 00:33:53,889
Je, una takataka au majivu ya sigara?

689
00:33:53,912 --> 00:33:56,912
Sina takataka yoyote.

690
00:33:56,935 --> 00:33:59,468
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

691
00:33:59,491 --> 00:34:03,987
Tafadhali subiri kidogo hadi tutakapomaliza kujaza mafuta.

692
00:34:04,010 --> 00:34:08,610
Unahitaji kuonyesha risiti kwa wafanyakazi wa kampuni ya kukodisha gari.

693
00:34:08,633 --> 00:34:11,400
Risiti, ndiyo?

694
00:34:11,423 --> 00:34:16,837
Tutatoa pamoja na cheti cha kujaza hadi juu.

695
00:34:16,860 --> 00:34:19,193
Umenisaidia sana.

696
00:34:19,216 --> 00:34:21,850
Umechelewa kidogo.

697
00:34:21,873 --> 00:34:27,073
Tumemaliza kujaza mafuta.

698
00:34:27,096 --> 00:34:29,387
Ni bei gani?

699
00:34:29,411 --> 00:34:34,217
Jumla ni shilingi elfu nne na mia tano.

700
00:34:34,240 --> 00:34:37,458
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

701
00:34:37,482 --> 00:34:41,015
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia hii.

702
00:34:41,038 --> 00:34:45,171
Nitapenda kulipa kwa kadi hii.

703
00:34:45,194 --> 00:34:49,794
Tafadhali ingiza sahihi au nambari ya siri.

704
00:34:49,817 --> 00:34:54,220
Sawa, nimeingiza nambari ya siri.

705
00:34:54,244 --> 00:34:56,222
Asante sana.

706
00:34:56,245 --> 00:35:01,016
Hii ni kadi yako na risiti yenye cheti cha kujaza hadi juu.

707
00:35:01,039 --> 00:35:06,496
Inaandikwa 'imejazwa hadi juu', ndiyo?

708
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:10,218
Ndiyo, mpeleke kwa kampuni ya kukodisha gari.

709
00:35:10,241 --> 00:35:14,500
Je, duka la kurudisha gari lililokodishwa liko karibu na hapa?

710
00:35:14,524 --> 00:35:19,260
Ndiyo, pinda kulia kwenye pinde hili, liko karibu sana.

711
00:35:19,283 --> 00:35:21,117
Sawa, nimeelewa.

712
00:35:21,140 --> 00:35:23,740
Ni karibu sana, basi.

713
00:35:23,763 --> 00:35:31,840
Wakati wa kurudisha gari, wafanyakazi wataangalia kama kuna uharibifu wowote.

714
00:35:31,864 --> 00:35:35,945
Sawa, nitakagua kwa usalama.

715
00:35:35,968 --> 00:35:37,901
Asante sana.

716
00:35:37,924 --> 00:35:40,324
Safari njema.

717
00:35:40,347 --> 00:35:41,847
Sehemu ya 15: Mchakato wa Kukodisha Kimono / Mchakato wa Kukodisha Kimono

718
00:35:41,847 --> 00:35:44,096
Karibu sana.

719
00:35:44,120 --> 00:35:47,253
Karibu kwa huduma ya kukodisha kimono.

720
00:35:47,276 --> 00:35:48,810
Hujambo.

721
00:35:48,833 --> 00:35:51,689
Ningependa kukodisha kimono.

722
00:35:51,712 --> 00:35:54,571
Je, umefanya uhradhi?

723
00:35:54,594 --> 00:35:58,128
Ndiyo, nilifanya uhradhi mtandaoni.

724
00:35:58,151 --> 00:36:01,970
Naomba nipate jina lako?

725
00:36:01,993 --> 00:36:03,827
Smith.

726
00:36:03,850 --> 00:36:06,301
Bwana Smith, ndiyo?

727
00:36:06,324 --> 00:36:10,890
Leo una mpango wa kuvalishwa kimono na kupangwa nywele, ndio?

728
00:36:10,913 --> 00:36:13,748
Ndiyo, hiyo hiyo.

729
00:36:13,772 --> 00:36:18,573
Kwanza, chagua kimono unayopenda kutoka hapa.

730
00:36:18,596 --> 00:36:22,963
Zinazidi sana, nafanyikiwa kuchagua.

731
00:36:22,986 --> 00:36:27,070
Rangi za pinki na nyekundu zina umaarufu sana.

732
00:36:27,093 --> 00:36:30,860
Kimono hii ya buluu ni nzuri sana.

733
00:36:30,883 --> 00:36:33,684
Nitachagua rangi hii.

734
00:36:33,707 --> 00:36:36,676
Rangi hii ni nzuri sana.

735
00:36:36,700 --> 00:36:39,997
Sasa tutachague obi (ukanda).

736
00:36:40,020 --> 00:36:43,229
Unapendelea obi ipi?

737
00:36:43,253 --> 00:36:48,187
Kama utachagua obi ya manjano au nyeupe, itakuwa nzuri sana.

738
00:36:48,210 --> 00:36:52,305
Basi, nitachagua obi ya manjano.

739
00:36:52,328 --> 00:36:56,022
Ukubwa wa tabi (soksi za kimono) ni upi?

740
00:36:56,046 --> 00:37:00,865
Ukubwa wa mguu wangu ni sentimita 24.

741
00:37:00,889 --> 00:37:05,295
Tutakupatia tabi ya sentimita 24.

742
00:37:05,318 --> 00:37:09,085
Kuvikwa kimono kunachukua muda gani?

743
00:37:09,108 --> 00:37:14,241
Kuvikwa kimono na kupangwa nywele kunachukua dakika 30 hivi.

744
00:37:14,264 --> 00:37:16,998
Tafadhali nifanyie kuvikwa kimono.

745
00:37:17,021 --> 00:37:21,296
Tafadhali, nenda chumba cha kubadilisha nguo katika ghorofa ya pili.

746
00:37:21,319 --> 00:37:25,289
Je, naweza kuweka begi na nguo zangu hapa?

747
00:37:25,312 --> 00:37:29,999
Ndiyo, mizigo mikubwa tunayashika kwa ajili yako.

748
00:37:30,022 --> 00:37:31,598
Asante sana.

749
00:37:31,622 --> 00:37:33,822
Je, unaona nguo hazikufi?

750
00:37:33,845 --> 00:37:36,579
Inafaa vizuri.

751
00:37:36,602 --> 00:37:38,802
Umechelewa kidogo.

752
00:37:38,825 --> 00:37:41,760
Unaitika vizuri sana.

753
00:37:41,783 --> 00:37:45,158
Hii ni furaha kubwa kwangu!

754
00:37:45,182 --> 00:37:49,582
Tafadhali rudi dukani kabla ya saa kumi na moja jioni.

755
00:37:49,605 --> 00:37:51,855
Saa kumi na moja, ndio.

756
00:37:51,878 --> 00:37:53,934
Sawa, nimeelewa.

757
00:37:53,958 --> 00:37:58,011
Furahia kutembea mjini.

758
00:37:58,034 --> 00:37:59,680
Nitakwenda sasa.

759
00:37:59,703 --> 00:38:01,203
Sehemu ya 16: Ununuzi wa Tiketi za Makumbusho ya Sanaa / Kununua Tiketi na Kuingia Makumbusho ya Sanaa

760
00:38:01,203 --> 00:38:03,237
Karibu sana.

761
00:38:03,260 --> 00:38:05,677
Hii ni kaunta ya tiketi.

762
00:38:05,700 --> 00:38:09,067
Nitapenda tiketi mbili za watu wazima.

763
00:38:09,089 --> 00:38:11,760
Tiketi za leo za siku hii, ndio.

764
00:38:11,784 --> 00:38:15,479
Ndiyo, tunaweza kuingia sasa?

765
00:38:15,503 --> 00:38:19,315
Ndiyo, unaweza kuingia mara moja.

766
00:38:19,338 --> 00:38:22,180
Tiketi ya siku hii ni bei gani?

767
00:38:22,203 --> 00:38:27,770
Kwa kila mtu ni shilingi elfu mbili, kwa hiyo jumla ni shilingi nne elfu.

768
00:38:27,793 --> 00:38:31,193
Nitakulipa shilingi nne elfu.

769
00:38:31,216 --> 00:38:32,849
Asante sana.

770
00:38:32,872 --> 00:38:35,939
Hii ni tiketi yako na brosha.

771
00:38:35,962 --> 00:38:40,128
Je, naweza kupiga picha ndani ya jumba la makumbusho?

772
00:38:40,151 --> 00:38:45,318
Kwa kawaida, kupiga picha kunaruhusiwa, lakini matumizi ya flash ni marufuku.

773
00:38:45,341 --> 00:38:48,546
Ikiwa sitautumia flash, basi hakuna matatizo, ndio?

774
00:38:48,569 --> 00:38:52,736
Ndiyo, lakini kupiga video hakuruhusiwi.

775
00:38:52,759 --> 00:38:54,638
Sawa, nimeelewa.

776
00:38:54,661 --> 00:38:56,956
Nitapiga picha tu.

777
00:38:56,980 --> 00:39:01,613
Pia, begi kubwa lazima uziweke kwenye locker.

778
00:39:01,636 --> 00:39:05,203
Locker za sarafu ziko wapi?

779
00:39:05,226 --> 00:39:08,792
Zipo kushoto baada ya kuingia mlango.

780
00:39:08,815 --> 00:39:12,149
Je, sarafu ya shilingi mia moja inarudishwa?

781
00:39:12,172 --> 00:39:16,857
Ndiyo, aina hii inarudisha shilingi 100 baada ya matumizi.

782
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:18,213
Sawa, nzuri.

783
00:39:18,236 --> 00:39:22,770
Je, naweza kutoka nje na kuingia tena?

784
00:39:22,793 --> 00:39:26,999
Ukiweka stempu kwenye njia ya kutoka, utaweza kuingia tena.

785
00:39:27,022 --> 00:39:30,956
Ninapenda kula chakula cha mchana nje, ni msaada mkubwa.

786
00:39:30,979 --> 00:39:35,012
Unapotoka, tafadhali mpeleke sauti kwa wafanyakazi.

787
00:39:35,035 --> 00:39:36,890
Sawa, nimeelewa.

788
00:39:36,914 --> 00:39:40,480
Muda wa kutazama unachukua muda gani?

789
00:39:40,503 --> 00:39:45,437
Kuzunguka kila kitu kunachukua saa moja na nusu hivi.

790
00:39:45,461 --> 00:39:48,061
Nitazunguka polepole.

791
00:39:48,084 --> 00:39:53,684
Tuna maonyesho maalum pia nyuma hapa!

792
00:39:53,707 --> 00:39:55,961
Nitakwenda huko pia.

793
00:39:55,985 --> 00:39:57,485
Mstari wa 17: Shauri kuhusu Dawa ya Kichwa

794
00:39:57,485 --> 00:40:02,085
Hujambo, umekuja kwa nini leo?

795
00:40:02,108 --> 00:40:03,845
Kichwa kinaniuma.

796
00:40:03,868 --> 00:40:06,719
Kimeuma tangu lini?

797
00:40:06,743 --> 00:40:10,143
Kimeuma tangu asubuhi ya leo.

798
00:40:10,165 --> 00:40:12,899
Una homa?

799
00:40:12,923 --> 00:40:15,566
Sina homa.

800
00:40:15,590 --> 00:40:18,644
Una dawa ya mafua?

801
00:40:18,668 --> 00:40:22,474
Unatafuta dawa ya kukomesha maumivu?

802
00:40:22,498 --> 00:40:26,098
Ndiyo, nataka dawa ya kichwa.

803
00:40:26,121 --> 00:40:29,887
Kuna dawa unazokunywa kwa kawaida?

804
00:40:29,910 --> 00:40:33,444
Hapana, hakuna hasa.

805
00:40:33,467 --> 00:40:36,473
Una mzio wa dawa?

806
00:40:36,496 --> 00:40:39,463
Sina mzio wowote.

807
00:40:39,486 --> 00:40:43,739
Napendekeza dawa hii ya kupunguza homa na maumivu.

808
00:40:43,763 --> 00:40:46,496
Ninavyoichukua vipi?

809
00:40:46,519 --> 00:40:50,886
Chukua mara tatu kwa siku, baada ya chakula.

810
00:40:50,909 --> 00:40:54,042
Lazima nizichukue baada ya chakula?

811
00:40:54,065 --> 00:40:59,532
Ili kuzuia maumivu ya tumbo, inafaa ule kitu fulani kwanza.

812
00:40:59,555 --> 00:41:01,555
Sawa, nimeelewa.

813
00:41:01,577 --> 00:41:04,145
Ninachukua vidonge vingapi kwa wakati mmoja?

814
00:41:04,168 --> 00:41:08,002
Chukua vidonge viwili kwa wakati mmoja.

815
00:41:08,026 --> 00:41:11,882
Nipasie muda gani kati ya kila dozi?

816
00:41:11,906 --> 00:41:15,639
Tafadhali usichukue kabla ya saa nne zimetimia.

817
00:41:15,662 --> 00:41:19,513
Kuna dawa ya maumivu ya tumbo?

818
00:41:19,537 --> 00:41:23,513
Je, unataka kununua dawa ya tumbo pia?

819
00:41:23,536 --> 00:41:27,550
Ndiyo, nimekula sana na tumbo linaniuma.

820
00:41:27,574 --> 00:41:32,614
Basi, nitakupa dawa ya tumbo pia.

821
00:41:32,637 --> 00:41:35,448
Kuna vipengele vinavyosababisha usingizi?

822
00:41:35,471 --> 00:41:40,117
Dawa hii ya kichwa inaweza kusababisha usingizi kidogo.

823
00:41:40,141 --> 00:41:44,786
Siku hizi sitasafiri kwa gari, basi hakuna matatizo.

824
00:41:44,809 --> 00:41:47,102
Hiyo ni njema.

825
00:41:47,125 --> 00:41:49,792
Upoe pole.

826
00:41:49,815 --> 00:41:52,148
Asante sana.

827
00:41:52,171 --> 00:41:53,671
Mstari wa 18: Kuagiza Takoyaki Kwenye Kibanda cha Njia

828
00:41:53,671 --> 00:41:56,162
Karibu sana.

829
00:41:56,186 --> 00:41:58,719
Harufu inayongoza sana!

830
00:41:58,742 --> 00:42:01,109
Kibanda cha nini hiki?

831
00:42:01,132 --> 00:42:05,498
Hiki ni kibanda cha takoyaki na okonomiyaki.

832
00:42:05,521 --> 00:42:08,210
Nataka takoyaki moja tafadhali.

833
00:42:08,234 --> 00:42:12,634
Sawa, takoyaki pakiti moja.

834
00:42:12,657 --> 00:42:15,700
Je, naweza kuchagua ladha?

835
00:42:15,724 --> 00:42:20,257
Kuna sosini, shoyu, na ponzu.

836
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:23,247
Ni ipi inayopendwa zaidi?

837
00:42:23,270 --> 00:42:28,003
Kama kawaida, ladha ya sosini ndiyo inayopendwa zaidi.

838
00:42:28,026 --> 00:42:31,307
Basi, nitachukua ladha ya sosini.

839
00:42:31,331 --> 00:42:35,380
Unaweza kuongeza mayonezi na nori ya kijani.

840
00:42:35,404 --> 00:42:39,137
Ndiyo, tafadhali ongeza kwa wingi.

841
00:42:39,160 --> 00:42:43,167
Nitaweka katsuobushi kwa kiasi cha kutikisika.

842
00:42:43,191 --> 00:42:44,767
Asante sana.

843
00:42:44,791 --> 00:42:47,400
Naweza kula hapa?

844
00:42:47,423 --> 00:42:52,757
Kuna benchi karibu na kibanda, unaweza kula huko.

845
00:42:52,780 --> 00:42:55,852
Inaonekana moto sana kwa sababu imetiwa moto karibuni.

846
00:42:55,875 --> 00:43:00,809
Katikati ni moto sana, angalia usije ukajichoma.

847
00:43:00,832 --> 00:43:04,681
Sawa, nitakula kwa tahadhari.

848
00:43:04,704 --> 00:43:07,937
Jumla ni shilingi 600.

849
00:43:07,960 --> 00:43:11,233
Je, naweza kutumia kadi ya mkopo?

850
00:43:11,257 --> 00:43:16,149
Samahani, tunakubali fedha taslimu tu.

851
00:43:16,172 --> 00:43:18,179
Sawa, nimeelewa.

852
00:43:18,203 --> 00:43:20,823
Nitakulipa kwa pesa taslimu.

853
00:43:20,846 --> 00:43:23,916
Tutakupokea pesa sahihi.

854
00:43:23,939 --> 00:43:27,106
Unauza vinywaji pia?

855
00:43:27,129 --> 00:43:31,295
Tuna ramune baridi na bia ya mkebe.

856
00:43:31,318 --> 00:43:34,594
Tafadhali, nipe ramune moja.

857
00:43:34,618 --> 00:43:40,251
Sawa, ni shilingi 200 za ziada, jumla ni shilingi 800.

858
00:43:40,274 --> 00:43:43,571
Sijui jinsi ya kufungua chupa hii.

859
00:43:43,595 --> 00:43:47,361
Bonyeza tu kidonge kilicho juu kwa nguvu, itafunguka.

860
00:43:47,384 --> 00:43:50,041
Nifungulie?

861
00:43:50,065 --> 00:43:51,798
Tafadhali.

862
00:43:51,821 --> 00:43:55,040
Tazama, imefunguka.

863
00:43:55,064 --> 00:43:57,744
Kula kwa furaha.

864
00:43:57,767 --> 00:44:00,252
Asante kwa ukaribu wako.

865
00:44:00,276 --> 00:44:01,776
Sehemu ya 19: Jinsi ya Kutuma Barua Kimataifa

866
00:44:01,776 --> 00:44:03,976
Karibu sana.

867
00:44:03,999 --> 00:44:06,855
Tafadhali nendeni kwenye dirisha la posta.

868
00:44:06,878 --> 00:44:10,919
Ninataka kutuma hii nje ya nchi.

869
00:44:10,943 --> 00:44:14,343
Sawa, ni barua ya kimataifa.

870
00:44:14,366 --> 00:44:17,701
Unataka kutuma mpaka nchi gani?

871
00:44:17,724 --> 00:44:21,058
Ninataka kutuma mpaka Marekani.

872
00:44:21,081 --> 00:44:24,056
Kuna nini ndani?

873
00:44:24,079 --> 00:44:28,133
Kuna zawadi za chakula na nguo.

874
00:44:28,157 --> 00:44:32,095
Kuna vifaa hatari au kiowevu?

875
00:44:32,118 --> 00:44:34,518
Hakuna.

876
00:44:34,541 --> 00:44:37,874
Nitapima uzito wa mzigo.

877
00:44:37,897 --> 00:44:41,179
Tafadhali weka juu ya mizani.

878
00:44:41,203 --> 00:44:44,136
Sawa, nimeweka.

879
00:44:44,159 --> 00:44:46,733
Ni kilo mbili kamili.

880
00:44:46,757 --> 00:44:48,991
Itatwaa muda gani kufika?

881
00:44:49,014 --> 00:44:54,414
Kama ni EMS, itafika kwa ndege katika siku tano hivi.

882
00:44:54,436 --> 00:44:58,203
Ikiwa ni kwa meli, itachukua muda gani?

883
00:44:58,226 --> 00:45:02,626
Kwa meli, itachukua miezi mbili hivi.

884
00:45:02,649 --> 00:45:07,082
Ninataka ifike haraka, basi nitachagua EMS.

885
00:45:07,105 --> 00:45:09,239
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

886
00:45:09,262 --> 00:45:12,748
Umeunda lebo mtandaoni?

887
00:45:12,772 --> 00:45:17,372
Hapana, sijaunda bado.

888
00:45:17,395 --> 00:45:22,528
Tafadhali ingiza anwani kwa simu yako na uunde lebo.

889
00:45:22,551 --> 00:45:25,618
Kuna karatasi ya maelezo ya jinsi ya kuandika?

890
00:45:25,641 --> 00:45:30,255
Soma msimbo wa QR huu ili kuingiza taarifa.

891
00:45:30,278 --> 00:45:32,611
Imekwisha.

892
00:45:32,634 --> 00:45:34,903
Bakodi imetoka.

893
00:45:34,927 --> 00:45:36,606
Asante sana.

894
00:45:36,629 --> 00:45:39,696
Tutakaprinti hapa.

895
00:45:39,719 --> 00:45:45,052
Je, naweza kutuma sanduku langu hadi uwanja wa ndege nchini Japani?

896
00:45:45,075 --> 00:45:50,842
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia huduma yetu ya upelekaji kwenye uwanja wa ndege.

897
00:45:50,865 --> 00:45:54,515
Nitume siku ngapi kabla ya siku ya kufika?

898
00:45:54,539 --> 00:45:59,539
Tafadhali lipeleke hapa siku mbili kabla ya safari yako.

899
00:45:59,562 --> 00:46:03,242
Ni rahisi kwani unaweza kutembea bila mzigo, ni vizuri sana!

900
00:46:03,265 --> 00:46:06,946
Tafadhali tumia huduma hii mara nyingine.

901
00:46:06,969 --> 00:46:09,784
Bei ya usafirishaji leo ni kiasi gani?

902
00:46:09,808 --> 00:46:14,183
Kwa huduma ya EMS, ni yenye namba 4500.

903
00:46:14,207 --> 00:46:17,419
Nitamlipa kwa pesa za kidigitali.

904
00:46:17,442 --> 00:46:19,409
Tafadhali pigia hapa kwa kifaa chako.

905
00:46:19,432 --> 00:46:22,116
Asante sana.

906
00:46:22,139 --> 00:46:23,639
Sehemu ya 20: Darsa ya Kujifunza Chai ya Kijani (Matcha)

907
00:46:23,639 --> 00:46:25,472
Hujambo.

908
00:46:25,495 --> 00:46:28,978
Karibu kwenye darsa ya chai ya kijani (matcha).

909
00:46:29,002 --> 00:46:30,935
Hujambo.

910
00:46:30,958 --> 00:46:34,430
Nimekuja leo nikitarajia sana.

911
00:46:34,454 --> 00:46:36,743
Asante sana.

912
00:46:36,766 --> 00:46:40,903
Kwanza, tafadhali kula kitindamlo hiki.

913
00:46:40,927 --> 00:46:44,127
Je, ninakula kabla ya chai?

914
00:46:44,150 --> 00:46:45,810
Ndio.

915
00:46:45,833 --> 00:46:51,452
Kula kitindamlo tamu kwanza kunafanya chai kuwa ladha nzuri zaidi.

916
00:46:51,475 --> 00:46:53,208
Sawa, nimeelewa.

917
00:46:53,231 --> 00:46:55,564
Nitakula sasa.

918
00:46:55,587 --> 00:47:00,058
Sasa, tutajaribu kutengeneza chai.

919
00:47:00,082 --> 00:47:02,582
Ninapata chai hii vipi?

920
00:47:02,605 --> 00:47:06,742
Kwanza, tutaingiza maji moto kwenye kikombe.

921
00:47:06,766 --> 00:47:10,847
Unautumia kifaa cha mwanzi kinachoitwa chasen, sivyo?

922
00:47:10,871 --> 00:47:12,507
Ndio.

923
00:47:12,530 --> 00:47:16,930
Tumia kiwiko chako na ufanye haraka.

924
00:47:16,953 --> 00:47:19,153
Hivi ndivyo?

925
00:47:19,176 --> 00:47:22,510
Haitengenezi povu vizuri.

926
00:47:22,533 --> 00:47:25,866
Jaribu tena.

927
00:47:25,889 --> 00:47:30,730
Siri ni kutikisa kiwiko, si kifundo cha mkono.

928
00:47:30,754 --> 00:47:35,230
Aa, povu zimeanza kutokea vizuri!

929
00:47:35,254 --> 00:47:38,087
Umefanya vizuri sana!

930
00:47:38,110 --> 00:47:41,154
Je, ni lazima nizame kwa miguu iliyokunjwa?

931
00:47:41,178 --> 00:47:46,711
Kama miguu inakuuma, unaweza kukaa kwa urahisi.

932
00:47:46,734 --> 00:47:49,018
Umenisaidia sana.

933
00:47:49,041 --> 00:47:52,041
Miguu yangu imesikia kama imekufa.

934
00:47:52,064 --> 00:47:55,998
Unaweza pia kutumia kiti.

935
00:47:56,021 --> 00:47:59,954
Je, ninapasuka kikombe wakati wa kunywa?

936
00:47:59,977 --> 00:48:01,853
Ndio.

937
00:48:01,877 --> 00:48:07,810
Ili kuepuka sehemu ya mbele, zungusha mara mbili kwa mwelekeo wa saa.

938
00:48:07,833 --> 00:48:11,833
Hii ni adabu ya kuonyesha huruma kwa mtu mwingine, sivyo?

939
00:48:11,856 --> 00:48:14,256
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

940
00:48:14,279 --> 00:48:16,612
Unafahamu vizuri!

941
00:48:16,635 --> 00:48:21,693
Ni chungu kidogo, lakini ladha yake ni nzuri sana.

942
00:48:21,716 --> 00:48:27,250
Mwishowe, kunywa kwa sauti ndogo ili kumaliza.

943
00:48:27,273 --> 00:48:30,750
Hii ni ishara ya kumaliza kunywa, sivyo?

944
00:48:30,773 --> 00:48:32,387
Ndio.

945
00:48:32,411 --> 00:48:35,944
Umefanya kazi nzuri sana leo.

946
00:48:35,967 --> 00:48:40,940
Nimefurahia sana kujifunza utamaduni wa jadi wa Japani.

947
00:48:40,964 --> 00:48:44,402
Nimefurahi sana uliopata furaha.